                    <li>Error appears</li>
                </ol>
            ]]></field>
            <field name="fix_commit">eda48ee</field>
            <field name="fix_notes"><![CDATA[
                <p>Deployment issue - code was correct but cached.</p>
                <p>Mail notification signature already fixed in repository.</p>
                <p>Required cache clear/deployment.</p>
            ]]></field>
            <field name="fixed_date">2025-10-27 14:30:00</field>
        </record>

        <!-- Khaled Error #5: SOV Tab Missing (Clarification) -->
        <record id="error_khaled_05_sov_tab_location" model="error.report">
            <field name="name">SOV Tab Missing on Pro-forma (Design Clarification)</field>
            <field name="reporter_id" ref="base.user_admin"/>
            <field name="report_date">2025-10-27 12:00:00</field>
            <field name="error_location">Sales → Pro-forma Invoice → Tabs</field>
            <field name="module_name">freezoner_custom</field>
            <field name="impact">low</field>
            <field name="status">wont_fix</field>
            <field name="priority">0</field>
            <field name="description"><![CDATA[
                <p>Looked for SOV tab on pro-forma invoice.</p>
                <p>Could not find it to enter expenses and calculate profit.</p>
            ]]></field>
            <field name="error_message">N/A - Not an error</field>
            <field name="steps_to_reproduce"><![CDATA[
                <ol>
                    <li>Open pro-forma invoice (PFI...)</li>
                    <li>Look through tabs</li>
                    <li>SOV tab not visible</li>
                </ol>
            ]]></field>
            <field name="fix_notes"><![CDATA[
                <p>This is BY DESIGN, not an error.</p>
                <p>SOV tab is on Customer Invoices (INV...), not Pro-formas (PFI...).</p>
                <p>Workflow: Confirm pro-forma → Open customer invoice → SOV tab appears.</p>
            ]]></field>
        </record>

